{"4459590":{"success":true,"data":{"type":"game","name":"Slotbound","steam_appid":4459590,"required_age":0,"is_free":false,"controller_support":"full","dlc":[4906570],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master your luck or be consumed by it! Slotbound is a solo-developed roguelite defense game that fuses explosive 3x3 slot machine jackpots with deep autobattler strategy. Pull the lever to summon units, trigger massive synergies, and crush endless waves of enemies. It's time to put your luck and intellect to the ultimate test!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4459590\/extras\/25d3872b00e34ad729e39869ddf757e9.avif?t=1793117762\" width=1170 height=200 \/><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Pull the Lever! Say Goodbye to Ordinary Defense Games!<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tired of the same old tower defense? We've injected pure dopamine into the very core of combat preparation. Spin the 3x3 slot machine, match the lines, and summon your units. Feeling unlucky? Don't panic. There's nothing quite like the thrill of a single, desperate spin triggering a massive jackpot, filling the screen and summoning a legendary Prism unit to save the day.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4459590\/extras\/f7121f04141c5059f7d85e8d6821a46b.poster.avif?t=1793117762\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4459590\/extras\/f7121f04141c5059f7d85e8d6821a46b.webm?t=1793117762\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4459590\/extras\/f7121f04141c5059f7d85e8d6821a46b.mp4?t=1793117762\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Absorb, Evolve, and Reign Supreme<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There's no such thing as a useless unit on this battlefield. Weaker units are sacrificed to feed the strong, becoming their flesh and blood. Watch an ordinary 1 star Warrior ascend into a stronger unit. Your branching class choices will completely shift the tide of battle.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4459590\/extras\/254f41d3ac531777354dab4891f40b7e.poster.avif?t=1793117762\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4459590\/extras\/254f41d3ac531777354dab4891f40b7e.webm?t=1793117762\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4459590\/extras\/254f41d3ac531777354dab4891f40b7e.mp4?t=1793117762\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Infinite Synergies That Overpower Pure Luck<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This isn't just a mindless slot machine where you leave everything to chance. Every time a unit spawns, it rolls from dozens of 'Random Stats'. Combine these with unique unit 'Imprints', powerful Items, and game-changing Cores.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Trigger explosive Core synergies through meticulous planning. Exploit system loopholes, bend RNG to your will, and become the master architect of your own victory.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4459590\/extras\/7908ae17cd1433dac504ad0ee49f5dfb.poster.avif?t=1793117762\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4459590\/extras\/7908ae17cd1433dac504ad0ee49f5dfb.webm?t=1793117762\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4459590\/extras\/7908ae17cd1433dac504ad0ee49f5dfb.mp4?t=1793117762\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Forge Your Own Destiny<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Slotbound is being made by one solo developer, built around the thrill of turning luck into strategy. Will you play it safe, or risk your life for maximum profit? Are you ready? The gold is stacked. Now, it's time to pull the lever! <\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p>","about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master your luck or be consumed by it! Slotbound is a solo-developed roguelite defense game that fuses explosive 3x3 slot machine jackpots with deep autobattler strategy. Pull the lever to summon units, trigger massive synergies, and crush endless waves of enemies. It's time to put your luck and intellect to the ultimate test!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4459590\/extras\/25d3872b00e34ad729e39869ddf757e9.avif?t=1793117762\" width=1170 height=200 \/><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Pull the Lever! Say Goodbye to Ordinary Defense Games!<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tired of the same old tower defense? We've injected pure dopamine into the very core of combat preparation. Spin the 3x3 slot machine, match the lines, and summon your units. Feeling unlucky? Don't panic. There's nothing quite like the thrill of a single, desperate spin triggering a massive jackpot, filling the screen and summoning a legendary Prism unit to save the day.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_i