ombine these with unique unit 'Imprints', powerful Items, and game-changing Cores.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Trigger explosive Core synergies through meticulous planning. Exploit system loopholes, bend RNG to your will, and become the master architect of your own victory.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4459590\/extras\/7908ae17cd1433dac504ad0ee49f5dfb.poster.avif?t=1793117762\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4459590\/extras\/7908ae17cd1433dac504ad0ee49f5dfb.webm?t=1793117762\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4459590\/extras\/7908ae17cd1433dac504ad0ee49f5dfb.mp4?t=1793117762\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Forge Your Own Destiny<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Slotbound is being made by one solo developer, built around the thrill of turning luck into strategy. Will you play it safe, or risk your life for maximum profit? Are you ready? The gold is stacked. Now, it's time to pull the lever! <\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p>","short_description":"A roguelike auto-battler defense where luck meets strategy. Spin a 3x3 slot machine to summon units and grow your army by absorbing others. Use Items and Cores to manipulate the odds and survive challenging judgement waves and boss waves. Every spin and every choice counts.","supported_languages":"English, Korean, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Japanese, Russian, Simplified Chinese, Polish, Portuguese - Brazil, Traditional Chinese","header_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4459590\/560f439f789caa08634fbf9ff462c73bf06fbf41\/header.jpg?t=1793117762","c